{"3689210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HYPERFIST", "steam_appid": 3689210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1783744534\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Deliver the most radical punch in HYPERFIST, the fast-paced punk-rock first person puncher game! After the deed to the planet Earth was acquired by the robotic Khi Corporation, they descended to terraform the whole place into a huge planetary parking lot. Play as the local punk who wants nothing more than to punch the capitalist corpos in their stupid robot faces. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1783744534\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use your radical mecha-fists</strong> to unleash combos and flashy specials against corporate bots that completely deserve it!<br></li><li><strong>Keep your combo up!</strong> The more stylishly you play, the more powerful your fists become!<br></li><li><strong>Utilize your many movement abilities</strong> to rush through 3 levels, all full of dangerous enemy encounters!<br></li><li>Punch a path all the way to the top of Khi Corp's tower and <strong>take down the enormous final boss</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Jam to the amazing punk-rock soundtrack</strong> as you fight off waves of robotic enemies!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1783744534\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1783744534\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Deliver the most radical punch in HYPERFIST, the fast-paced punk-rock first person puncher game! After the deed to the planet Earth was acquired by the robotic Khi Corporation, they descended to terraform the whole place into a huge planetary parking lot. Play as the local punk who wants nothing more than to punch the capitalist corpos in their stupid robot faces. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1783744534\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use your radical mecha-fists</strong> to unleash combos and flashy specials against corporate bots that completely deserve it!<br></li><li><strong>Keep your combo up!</strong> The more stylishly you play, the more powerful your fists become!<br></li><li><strong>Utilize your many movement abilities</strong> to rush through 3 levels, all full of dangerous enemy encounters!<br></li><li>Punch a path all the way to the top of Khi Corp's tower and <strong>take down the enormous final boss</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Jam to the amazing punk-rock soundtrack</strong> as you fight off waves of robotic enemies!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1783744534\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.", "short_description